        "message": "Fix truncated varints at the end of a message or packed field being accepted\n\nIf a varint at the end of an embedded message or packed repeated field was\ntruncated by the field's length, parsing continued into the bytes that\nfollowed, returning an incorrect value instead of an error and leaving the\nparser at the wrong position in the outer message. Such varints now produce\nan `InvalidVarint` error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "e03440e546119b6919448050a9b8e6328d9eeb35",
